{"id":"657725","name":"金针菇拌牛肉","author":"蓝雨阳光780913","authorId":"11379263","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/657725/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"牛肉","amount":"300g"},{"name":"金针菇","amount":"300g"}],"sub":[{"name":"豆芽儿","amount":"100g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"金针菇去掉根部洗净。","img":"images/657725/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放入锅中煮开。","img":"images/657725/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"豆芽儿洗净。","img":"images/657725/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"把豆芽儿放入金针菇中一起煮5分钟。","img":"images/657725/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"牛肉切成片，用姜碎和蒜碎拌匀。","img":"images/657725/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"小米辣切成小段。","img":"images/657725/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入搅拌器打碎。","img":"images/657725/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"煮熟的金针菇和豆芽儿捞出，用煮菜的水煮牛肉。","img":"images/657725/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"水再次煮开。","img":"images/657725/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"捞出牛肉沥水。","img":"images/657725/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放入装了煮熟的金针菇和豆芽儿大盆中。","img":"images/657725/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"加入各种调料拌匀。","img":"images/657725/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"装盘即可。","img":"images/657725/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}